+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 40-57-380.</span> Effect of termination, expiration, completion or performance of agency agreements; accounting and confidentiality.<br /><br />
+	A real estate broker and all supervised licensees owe no duty or obligation to a client following termination, expiration, completion, or performance of an agency agreement or closing of the real property transaction, whichever occurs first, except the duties of:<br /><br />
